          "source_pdf_sha256": "d52d16ff2d82aebefe812e7d4a257ae599f0202e55c33f4e4a01c87adf8e4022",
          "section_anchor": "1 Lernen im Fach Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 4,
          "physical_page": 4
        },
        "cited_text": "psychologisch \ninformierte, kritische Reflexions- und Handlungskompetenz",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Because it draws on natural-, social-, humanities- and arts-related aspects, psychology is a bridging subject (Brückenfach).",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek1-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Gymnasium Sekundarstufe I — Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "d52d16ff2d82aebefe812e7d4a257ae599f0202e55c33f4e4a01c87adf8e4022",
          "section_anchor": "1 Lernen im Fach Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 5,
          "physical_page": 5
        },
        "cited_text": "Insofern stellt das Fach Psychologie ein Brückenfach dar",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Individual self-experience must not become the direct object of instruction.",
        "citation": {
